`print` men skin tany. F el file da ekteb `ektb`.

10│     print("total {n}")
        ^^^^^

Garrab: `ektb`

Mosa3da: Ghayar `print` b `ektb`, aw shaghal `kalam convert` 3ashan yekteb el block el mansookh tany. W law te2sod esm men 3andak, 3arrafo el awel aw ektebo bein backticks.

